# Project Images

Place your project images in this folder with the following naming convention:
- slidein.jpg (or .png/.gif) - SlideIn project
- ecommerce.jpg - E-commerce Platform  
- climate.jpg - Climate Data Visualization
- taskmanager.jpg - Task Management App

Recommended image specifications:
- Size: 1024x768 or similar 4:3 aspect ratio
- Format: JPG, PNG, or GIF (for demos)
- File size: Keep under 2MB for good performance

To add a new image:
1. Save your image file in this folder
2. Update the image path in ProjectsSection.tsx
3. Use the format: "/images/projects/your-image-name.jpg"
